{"unit_id":"sijidoubi__dsh-plugin-mermaid#feature-1","repo":"sijidoubi/dsh-plugin-mermaid","commit":"5e96aa87ccdf22dac88bbbb76d3af7e2299f7cc2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-mermaid 的功能「渲染 Mermaid 图」：将图表源码转为 SVG 并解析宽高。调用 mermaid_render 时传入 code，可选 title；结果提供 SVG、尺寸和 data URI。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:129-180","src/renderer.ts:251-265"]}
{"unit_id":"sijidoubi__dsh-plugin-mermaid#feature-2","repo":"sijidoubi/dsh-plugin-mermaid","commit":"5e96aa87ccdf22dac88bbbb76d3af7e2299f7cc2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-mermaid 的功能「Web 图片链接」：检测到 DSH webServer 服务时，工具按需注册 SVG 路由并返回图片 URL，便于聊天界面展示和点击查看；没有 Web 服务时则返回 data URI。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:107-127","src/index.ts:170-188"]}
{"unit_id":"sijidoubi__dsh-plugin-mermaid#feature-3","repo":"sijidoubi/dsh-plugin-mermaid","commit":"5e96aa87ccdf22dac88bbbb76d3af7e2299f7cc2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-mermaid 的功能「适配 Node 的 SVG 布局」：使用 jsdom 提供 DOM 环境，并补充文本宽高测量方法，让 Mermaid 能在 Node 进程中布局图表标签。调用渲染工具时自动准备该环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/renderer.ts:4-16","src/renderer.ts:40-60","src/renderer.ts:228-241"]}
{"unit_id":"sijidoubi__dsh-plugin-mermaid#feature-4","repo":"sijidoubi/dsh-plugin-mermaid","commit":"5e96aa87ccdf22dac88bbbb76d3af7e2299f7cc2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-mermaid 的功能「输出合法 SVG」：渲染后会修正 HTML 空元素的 XML 写法，并从 viewBox 提取宽高；空源码或无效图表会返回带有渲染错误信息的失败结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/renderer.ts:251-295"]}
{"unit_id":"sijidoubi__dsh-plugin-mermaid#caveat-1","repo":"sijidoubi/dsh-plugin-mermaid","commit":"5e96aa87ccdf22dac88bbbb76d3af7e2299f7cc2","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-mermaid 使用渲染器时会在 Node 进程设置 jsdom 的 window、document 等全局对象；宿主中其他依赖 DOM 全局的库可能因此受到影响。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/renderer.ts:40-60"]}
